# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for Gemini AI API calls.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets.
# Users configure this via the Secrets panel in the AI Studio UI.
GEMINI_API_KEY="MY_GEMINI_API_KEY"

# APP_URL: The URL where this applet is hosted.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime with the Cloud Run service URL.
# Used for self-referential links, OAuth callbacks, and API endpoints.
APP_URL="MY_APP_URL"



# ============================================================================
# FIREBASE CONFIGURATION (PROJECT: urbandirectintracity)
# ============================================================================
# Client configuration is loaded from /firebase-applet-config.json (projectId: "urbandirectintracity").
# Mobile OTP authentication uses native Firebase Phone Authentication (RecaptchaVerifier + signInWithPhoneNumber).
# No Twilio credentials (TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID, TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN, TWILIO_VERIFY_SERVICE_SID) are required.
# No paid Google Maps Geocoding API key (GOOGLE_MAPS_GEOCODING_API_KEY) is required.
#
# Required Firebase Console Settings for project `urbandirectintracity`:
# 1. Authentication -> Sign-in method -> Enable "Phone" provider.
# 2. Authentication -> Settings -> Authorized domains -> Add your preview/production domain and localhost.
# 3. Authentication -> Sign-in method -> Phone -> "Phone numbers for testing" (optional for free development/testing):
#    Add test numbers (e.g., +91 9820451290 -> code 123456, +91 9823011223 -> code 123456) to test without SMS charges.
# 4. Billing / SMS Quotas -> Upgrade project `urbandirectintracity` to the Blaze plan and configure
#    SMS Region Policy in Firebase Console when sending live carrier SMS messages in production.
